OL,3,GNEWSANearly 200 compete in debut games
OL,4,Afor older people
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost 200 competitors over the age of
OL,7,F60 have competed in an inaugural sports
OL,8,Fcompetition.
OL,10,FTeams from Carlisle, Westmorland and
OL,11,FGateshead were among the competitors at
OL,12,Fthe Northern England Better Club Games,
OL,13,Fwhich took place at Penrith Leisure
OL,14,FCentre on Tuesday - with the team from
OL,15,FCarlisle named as this year's inaugural
OL,16,Fwinners.
OL,18,FThe seniors battled it out across a
OL,19,Fvariety of games including walking
OL,20,Fnetball, Pickleball and Scrabble.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
