OL,3,GNEWSANearly 200 compete in debut games
OL,4,Afor older people
OL,5,
OL,6,FCompetitor Maureen Luckhurst, from
OL,7,FPenrith, urged more older people to
OL,8,Fcome along and join their local sports
OL,9,Fteam. "They'll be glad to have you,"
OL,10,Fshe said.
